00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:49.082
Its serverless before serverless
was this cool, trendy buzzword.

00:07:49.082 --> 00:07:50.540
STEREN GIANNINI:
So we can even say

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:53.310
that App Engine was here
before Google Cloud was

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:54.090
