00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:56.840
App Engine was the platform
before Google Cloud platform

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:57.650
even existed.

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:58.500
MELANIE WARRICK:
It started it all.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:07:59.780
