00:21:39.949 --> 00:21:41.740
STEWART REICHLING: So
continued investment.

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:43.490
I think App Engine is
the thing that we're

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.640
going to continue investing
in pretty heavily.

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:47.980
Obviously, serverless
as a broader concept

00:21:47.980 --> 00:21:50.030
with Cloud Functions
and App Engine

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:52.390
