Tasks, Cloud Scheduler.

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:03.250
We're also looking
into new features

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:04.780
and how we can
continue to improve

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:06.827
App Engine, for example,
on the networking side,

00:22:06.827 --> 00:22:08.410
we're always trying
to tune our scaler

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:10.150
to make it more performant.

00:22:10.150 --> 00:22:12.730
And so you're going to see
basically more of the stuff

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:14.689
that we've been doing
over the last few months.

00:22:14.689 --> 00:22:15.646
MARK MANDEL: Excellent.

00:22:15.646 --> 00:22:17.490
And so what would you
want developers to do?

00:22:17.490 --> 00:22:19.479
